{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-optimization","title":"送达率优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/delivery-optimization","wordCount":1710,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"送达率优化\">送达率优化</h1><p>推送&quot;发出去&quot;不等于用户&quot;收到了&quot;。Airship 2026 年基准报告显示全球推送 opt-in 率平均 61%（iOS 56%，Android 67%），而实际送达率在亚洲市场更低——FCM 在东南亚的送达率约 69%，在中国大陆由于 GMS 缺失几乎为零。2025 年中国行业平均推送成功率达 95.3%（头部服务商数据），但这一数字建立在多通道聚合的基础上。本篇聚焦从技术层面提升单通道送达率的核心策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>送达漏斗</strong>：消息从发送到用户感知的多级漏损模型（发送→接受→投递→展示→感知）</li>\n<li><strong>Priority</strong>：消息优先级，决定系统是立即唤醒设备还是批量延迟投递</li>\n<li><strong>TTL（Time to Live）</strong>：消息存活时间，设备离线时 Gateway 保留消息的最长时长</li>\n<li><strong>指数退避（Exponential Backoff）</strong>：遇到限流/服务错误时的重试策略，避免惊群效应</li>\n<li><strong>Collapse Key/ID</strong>：消息合并标识，同一 Key 的多条消息在通知中心只保留最新一条</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"送达漏斗模型\">送达漏斗模型</h2><p>一条推送从服务端发出到用户看到，经历多级漏损：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[消息发送] --&gt; B[平台网关接受&lt;br/&gt;HTTP 200]&#10;    B --&gt; C[设备在线&lt;br/&gt;网关成功投递]&#10;    C --&gt; D[系统展示通知&lt;br/&gt;未被渠道屏蔽]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用户看到&lt;br/&gt;未被折叠/摘要]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|Token 无效/过期| F[发送失败]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|设备离线 + TTL 过期| G[消息丢弃]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|Channel 被关闭/DND| H[静默丢弃]&#10;    D -.-&gt;|通知被折叠/覆盖| I[用户未感知]\">graph TD\n    A[消息发送] --&gt; B[平台网关接受&lt;br/&gt;HTTP 200]\n    B --&gt; C[设备在线&lt;br/&gt;网关成功投递]\n    C --&gt; D[系统展示通知&lt;br/&gt;未被渠道屏蔽]\n    D --&gt; E[用户看到&lt;br/&gt;未被折叠/摘要]\n    A -.-&gt;|Token 无效/过期| F[发送失败]\n    B -.-&gt;|设备离线 + TTL 过期| G[消息丢弃]\n    C -.-&gt;|Channel 被关闭/DND| H[静默丢弃]\n    D -.-&gt;|通知被折叠/覆盖| I[用户未感知]</pre><p>每一级的优化策略不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏斗层级</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>优化杠杆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发送 → 网关接受</td>\n<td>接受率 (Acceptance Rate)</td>\n<td>Token 有效性维护、payload 格式正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网关 → 设备投递</td>\n<td>投递率 (Delivery Rate)</td>\n<td>Priority/TTL 配置、设备在线策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投递 → 展示</td>\n<td>展示率 (Display Rate)</td>\n<td>Channel 设计、权限引导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示 → 感知</td>\n<td>可见率 (Visibility Rate)</td>\n<td>collapse-id 策略、摘要优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"priority-与-ttl-配置策略\">Priority 与 TTL 配置策略</h2><p>Priority（优先级）和 TTL（消息存活时间）是影响送达率最直接的两个参数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"priority-选择矩阵\">Priority 选择矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>APNs priority</th>\n<th>FCM priority</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时消息/来电</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>high</td>\n<td>必须立即唤醒设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单状态变更</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>high</td>\n<td>时效性强，用户期望即时知晓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每日摘要</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>normal</td>\n<td>无即时性要求，可批量投递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销推送</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>normal</td>\n<td>省电优先，延迟可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置更新</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>normal</td>\n<td>完全不紧急，可大幅延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>误区警告</strong>：不要将所有消息都设为 high priority。APNs 和 FCM 都会对高优先级消息实施隐式限流——当系统检测到某 app 频繁发送 high priority 但用户未与之交互时，后续的 high priority 消息可能被自动降级为 normal。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ttl-配置策略\">TTL 配置策略</h3><p>TTL 决定了设备离线时消息在网关的存储时长。过短会导致消息丢失，过长会导致用户收到过时的信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>推荐 TTL</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聊天消息</td>\n<td>24-72 小时</td>\n<td>用户重新上线时应收到未读消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证码/OTP</td>\n<td>5-10 分钟</td>\n<td>过期后无意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限时优惠</td>\n<td>活动结束时间</td>\n<td>活动结束后推送反而造成负面体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直播开始</td>\n<td>直播时长</td>\n<td>直播结束后无价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新闻快讯</td>\n<td>1-4 小时</td>\n<td>新闻时效性衰减快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;android&quot;: { &quot;ttl&quot;: &quot;300s&quot; },&#10;    &quot;apns&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;headers&quot;: { &quot;apns-expiration&quot;: &quot;1721270700&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ttl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"300s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"apns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"apns-expiration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1721270700\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>APNs 的 <code>apns-expiration</code> 是绝对 UNIX 时间戳（设为 0 表示不存储，只投递当前在线设备）；FCM 的 <code>ttl</code> 是相对秒数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中国-android-生态送达优化\">中国 Android 生态送达优化</h2><p>中国大陆是推送送达的特殊战场：GMS 不可用、厂商 ROM 激进杀后台、用户习惯清理进程。送达率优化在此环境下演变为&quot;厂商通道适配&quot;工程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"厂商推送通道矩阵\">厂商推送通道矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>推送服务</th>\n<th>SDK 版本（2025）</th>\n<th>覆盖设备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>华为</td>\n<td>HMS Push Kit</td>\n<td>6.13.0.301</td>\n<td>EMUI/HarmonyOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小米</td>\n<td>MiPush</td>\n<td>5.x</td>\n<td>MIUI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OPPO</td>\n<td>OPPO Push</td>\n<td>3.x</td>\n<td>ColorOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vivo</td>\n<td>vivo Push</td>\n<td>3.x</td>\n<td>Funtouch/OriginOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荣耀</td>\n<td>荣耀 Push</td>\n<td>基于 HMS</td>\n<td>MagicOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>魅族</td>\n<td>Flyme Push</td>\n<td>4.x</td>\n<td>Flyme</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"统一推送联盟-upa\">统一推送联盟（UPA）</h3><p>中国信通院牵头的统一推送联盟（Unified Push Alliance）制定了统一推送标准，要求厂商在系统层面提供统一的推送能力。但截至 2025 年，各厂商的实现程度和接入方式仍有差异，实际工程中仍需逐一适配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进程保活与连接维护\">进程保活与连接维护</h3><p>在中国 Android 生态中，第三方推送 SDK（如个推、极光推送）的送达率提升策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>TCP 长连接保活</strong>：通过定时心跳包维持与推送服务器的连接（极光 2025 年将 Android 后台存活率从 61.4% 提升至 79.8%）</li>\n<li><strong>互相唤醒（已被限制）</strong>：早期多个 app 共享 SDK 可以互相唤起保持在线，Android 10+ 已大幅限制</li>\n<li><strong>前台服务</strong>：部分场景通过前台服务保持推送连接存活（需要展示通知，用户体验有争议）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"重试与退避策略\">重试与退避策略</h2><p>网关返回可重试错误时（429 TooManyRequests、5xx、网络超时），需要实施退避重试：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>jitter</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{wait} = \\min(T_{base} \\times 2^{n} + \\text{jitter}, T_{max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7977em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为重试次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常设为 1 秒，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设为 60 秒，jitter 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 1000)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 毫秒的随机值（防止大量 Provider 同时重试导致惊群效应）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误码</th>\n<th>是否重试</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>400 Bad Request</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>payload 格式错误，修复后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>401/403</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>认证失败，刷新 token 后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>404/410</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Token 无效，清除（见 <a href=\"token-management-lifecycle\">Token 管理与生命周期</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>429</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按 Retry-After 或指数退避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500/503</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>指数退避，最多重试 3-5 次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消息合并与去重\">消息合并与去重</h2><p>APNs 对同一设备同一 Bundle ID 仅存储最后一条通知。当业务在短时间内发送多条更新（如外卖配送状态连续变化）时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>apns-collapse-id</code>（APNs）/ <code>collapse_key</code>（FCM）将同类更新合并为一条</li>\n<li>在 payload 中携带最新状态的完整信息（而非增量），确保用户看到的始终是当前状态</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;token&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,&#10;    &quot;notification&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;配送中&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;骑手距您约800米&quot; },&#10;    &quot;android&quot;: { &quot;collapse_key&quot;: &quot;delivery_order_12345&quot; },&#10;    &quot;apns&quot;: { &quot;headers&quot;: { &quot;apns-collapse-id&quot;: &quot;delivery_order_12345&quot; } }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"notification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"配送中\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"骑手距您约800米\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"collapse_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delivery_order_12345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"apns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"apns-collapse-id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delivery_order_12345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"送达确认与回执\">送达确认与回执</h2><p>各平台的送达确认机制差异显著：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>送达回执</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>APNs</td>\n<td>无主动回执</td>\n<td>只有 HTTP 200 表示网关接受；可通过 Metrics API 查询状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCM</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n<td>FCM Diagnostics + BigQuery 导出可获取投递状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMS</td>\n<td>支持送达回执</td>\n<td>可配置回执回调 URL，系统主动推送送达/点击事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方服务</td>\n<td>通常支持</td>\n<td>个推/极光等均提供送达回执回调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于需要确认关键消息已送达的场景（如支付结果通知），仅依赖推送送达回执是不够的。应在 app 侧实现确认机制：收到通知后向服务端回报 ACK，服务端超时未收到 ACK 则触发 <a href=\"fallback-multi-channel\">降级与多通道策略</a> 中的备选通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>送达率优化是一个系统工程：Priority/TTL 配置决定消息的即时性与存活性；中国 Android 生态需要多厂商通道适配；重试策略处理暂时性故障；合并机制避免通知洪泛。核心原则是&quot;分类治理&quot;——不同重要度的消息采用不同的 Priority、TTL 和重试策略，而非一刀切。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"送达率优化","id":"送达率优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"送达漏斗模型","id":"送达漏斗模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Priority 与 TTL 配置策略","id":"priority-与-ttl-配置策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Priority 选择矩阵","id":"priority-选择矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"TTL 配置策略","id":"ttl-配置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"中国 Android 生态送达优化","id":"中国-android-生态送达优化"},{"level":3,"text":"厂商推送通道矩阵","id":"厂商推送通道矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"统一推送联盟（UPA）","id":"统一推送联盟-upa"},{"level":3,"text":"进程保活与连接维护","id":"进程保活与连接维护"},{"level":2,"text":"重试与退避策略","id":"重试与退避策略"},{"level":2,"text":"消息合并与去重","id":"消息合并与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"送达确认与回执","id":"送达确认与回执"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本地通知与定时调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/local-scheduled-notifications"},"next":{"title":"Token 管理与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/token-management-lifecycle"}}